# Conformance probe pack for C strings: `until:0 chars:ascii8` (spec 0.22).
# Public. No kinds. Most significant bit first. `tag` has a default (ruling
# 10: the default applies to an absent key before the terminator alone).
#
#   label  8-bit characters up to NUL
#   tag    8-bit characters up to NUL; default "zz"
format     conformance-long-until-ascii8
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.label  until:0  chars:ascii8
field   probe.tag    until:0  chars:ascii8
default probe.tag    zz
